<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 7.78 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 7.78 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index fell to 7.78 percent in the week ending March 1 from 7.91 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES  March 1,1997   Feb 22,1997   March 3,1996</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +7.78	   +7.91	   +5.13</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  322.7	   322.0	   299.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended March 3, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
